# Copy to .env.local to override anything below. .env.local is gitignored.

# Where the SQLite database file lives.
#
# Defaults to ~/.unimanager/unit-manager.db — deliberately OUTSIDE this repo,
# because this project folder is inside OneDrive and file-sync clients corrupt
# live SQLite databases by racing the writer for the .db / .db-wal / .db-shm
# trio. See lib/db/path.ts.
#
# If this repo ever moves off a synced drive, PRD.md §10's original location
# works fine:
# UNI_MANAGER_DB_PATH=./data/unit-manager.db
